{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e8aa0fde6b3003d78a522db834bc43b1b4315f4063c58d9c4fa17d887190a0f", "ja": "（歩がダンスを教えたキッズダンサーの子ども達と\nステージに上がる。さて、歩の様子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（步和她教过舞蹈的孩子们一起登上舞台。步现在的状态怎么样呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "30bd07a23fe3d415a10060035dc7809493adcddf8ce780b368a9a940d34cf168", "ja": "ううっ、ドキドキするなぁ……。\nいつもよりずっと緊張してるかも……。", "zh": "呜呜，好紧张啊……\n感觉比平时紧张多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1002_p", "source_sha256": "42a693b9809585e479f791eef2969f6d4749c4bcd81a75db2a76c8c5a1739f86", "ja": "お疲れさま、歩！\nなんだか顔色が……大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，步！\n你的脸色好像不太好……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "38d80c6413a829934c711d6e340e1064e5262548129895f20b6f0768cdd20b3e", "ja": "{$P$}、どうしよう～！\n今までのステージと違って、一番緊張してるかも！", "zh": "{$P$}，怎么办呀～！\n和之前的舞台不一样，我可能是最紧张的一次了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fa9c9577edac4b87baf65dbd1ba8576ba378d0650482e8c3e73798be8e122ccb", "ja": "でもでも、アタシより子どもたちの方が心配だよ！\n控室に行ったら、空気がすっごく重くてさ。", "zh": "不过不过，我更担心那些孩子们啊！\n我去休息室一看，气氛沉重得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b9f1c5176b9f738bc7c1d4b1def9eb8de49599a4a3dc3b181917ef929217bc05", "ja": "本番までに少しでも緊張をほぐしてあげたいんだけど\n……うう、なんにも思いつかないよ～！", "zh": "我想在正式演出前尽量帮她们缓解一下紧张，\n……呜呜，可我什么都想不出来啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1006_p", "source_sha256": "44190aca864670fd67251d16cae44d7fa1c83f68f117df6eba19c8cb2f142e9f", "ja": "まあまあ、少し落ち着こう。しかし歩の緊張の理由は、\n教え子を思ってのことだったんだな。", "zh": "好了好了，先冷静一点。不过，步之所以紧张，原来是因为担心自己的学生啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "32e56b04df25ef0c8ffc3e77c26a1dda3d9eb3d893d038b313eded51196850ae", "ja": "うん……。楽しみでワクワクするけど、大丈夫かな？\nってソワソワもあってさ。あ、あのさ……。", "zh": "嗯……虽然很期待也很兴奋，但又有点担心“没问题吧？”，\n搞得我静不下心来。那、那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5775f7063096dfec6ca9cae75f0c5cbcf5021b82324627c7445bc16a262a1d5d", "ja": "{$P$}も、こんな気持ちなの？\nいつもアタシたちの公演を見てる時って……。", "zh": "{$P$}也是这种心情吗？\n平时看着我们的公演的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9898576231d3af229848341cc00bdc1ef47b00300b8a285c836acc8d9fe03cae", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。みんながデビューした頃は、\n緊張もあったけど……今は、安心して見てるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。大家刚出道的时候，我也会紧张……但现在看你们的演出，已经能放心地看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6bd1b9a8cd6908de175026977a797b8c8b73291486b62cccedfb1ed4716ec7b6", "ja": "歩の時も、結構緊張した覚えがあるよ。\n昔の歩は、ステージに上がる前……。", "zh": "小步那时候，我也记得自己相当紧张。以前的小步，在登台之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0bfd1f5dc0b6baf0452a90720e69f36a8c0ad1622e8e104537940cd611e96491", "ja": "わーっ、わーっ！　その話はもういいよ！\n昔のことなんて思い出さなくていいからっ！", "zh": "哇——哇——！那件事就别再说啦！\n以前的事就不用想起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "69fd70db293658258270607b44216e1a141ec80417b2a2504e257d0702c127f1", "ja": "でも……へへっ、そっか。思ってたより、\n{$P$}に、心配かけてたんだね……。", "zh": "可是……嘿嘿，原来我比想象中更让\n{$P$}担心啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f1bb98115f8fef7abbf27ede923248ea5f690bab035ba0c77b2a2956f75bd925", "ja": "まあ、今でも緊張はするけど……\n昔に比べたら、ちょっとはマシになったと思うんだ。", "zh": "不过，虽然现在也还是会紧张……\n但比起以前，我觉得多少还是好一些了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0ba4acbf1c335af54571bd3235b426b1a08c8821d9bc9b16759733cd1bbc0856", "ja": "そうだな。歩も成長して、頼もしくなった証拠だ。\nだから、安心してステージを見てられる。", "zh": "是啊。这也证明阿步成长了，变得可靠了。\n所以，我可以放心地看着她登台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a8d5ab70c2dfdd83c863d009afcd75e020309a54ca660acf1f226b2ce348336", "ja": "それは……ほら。{$P$}が\n励ましてくれたから、安心して踊れたっていうか……。", "zh": "那是……因为，那个……{$P$}先生鼓励了我，所以才能安心地跳舞……算是吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3fb7cfab7d1ce7578bbef5ec03c7c52256a07c9e6f5f21e6d534020bf2b35b2f", "ja": "あっ……！　そっか。\nアタシも{$P$}と同じ……それなら！", "zh": "啊……！原来是这样。\n我也和{$P$}一样……既然这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0f5885a44ebdd9a2f0bd6369118acf266583ee5c9865b24b84aea086d8893e9a", "ja": "もう一度、みんなのところに行ってきたらどうだ？", "zh": "再去大家那边看看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4bbd1c660dd7c6edac0fb7df2740a1b421ec5482c0a84d363104d7c3fe2dbe0f", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}にしてもらって\n嬉しかったこと……アタシもやってみるよ！", "zh": "嗯！我也要试着去做让{$P$}感到开心的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "45c62402dafd1780a360fef32ed260b77fa8c711d38170b39f15c500cfe6defe", "ja": "話聞いてくれてありがと、{$P$}♪\nそれじゃ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "谢谢你听我说，{$P$}♪那么，我出发啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0334_1020_p", "source_sha256": "da436160a3b3f61651e2e3b560627d7379c96abacc244f24a25ad5795775849e", "ja": "（その後、歩はキッズダンサーたちと楽しそうに\nステージへ向かった。頼もしくなったな、歩……！）", "zh": "（之后，步和那些小舞者们一起，开心地走向了舞台。变得可靠多了啊，步……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
